---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Our local beginning"
  description="The True Hive brings soap-making, beekeeping, and a future collection of hive goods together in Madisonville, Tennessee."
>
  <section class="page-intro wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Meet the hands behind the hive</p>
    <h1>
      A local beginning.
      <br />
      <em>Good things ahead.</em>
    </h1>
    <p>
      Soap-making and beekeeping are where The True Hive begins. We're growing a
      collection close to home in Madisonville, Tennessee.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap prose-section">
    <h2>People before polish.</h2>
    <p>
      Our products and plans will be explained honestly: what is ready, what is
      still being developed, and how local pickup can work when online sales
      open.
    </p>
    <p>
      The illustrations you see here are original design studies. They aren't
      photographs of our apiary, a public store, or finished packaging. Real
      photographs and approved product details will take their place as the
      collection develops.
    </p>
    <h2>A thoughtful pace.</h2>
    <p>
      Soap leads the near-term collection. Honey retail availability is
      unconfirmed, candles remain planned, and future beekeeping services need
      their own assessment and capacity decisions.
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/goods">
      Explore the collection <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
